sequenceDiagram
  actor Cliente
  participant OS as OS Service
  participant RMQ as RabbitMQ
  participant Billing as Billing Service
  participant MP as Mercado Pago
  participant Exec as Execution Service

  Cliente->>OS: POST /api/ordens-servico
  OS->>OS: Persiste OS + saga_instance
  OS->>RMQ: orcamento.gerar
  RMQ->>Billing: consome comando
  Billing->>Billing: Grava orcamento MongoDB
  Billing->>RMQ: orcamento.gerado
  RMQ->>OS: atualiza AGUARDANDO_APROVACAO

  Cliente->>OS: POST aprovar-orcamento aprovado=true
  OS->>RMQ: pagamento.solicitar
  RMQ->>Billing: consome comando
  Billing->>MP: cria preferencia / mock auto-approve
  Billing->>RMQ: pagamento.aprovado
  RMQ->>OS: EM_EXECUCAO
  OS->>RMQ: execucao.iniciar
  RMQ->>Exec: enfileira job
  Exec->>RMQ: execucao.iniciada

  Cliente->>Exec: diagnostico / reparo / finalizar
  Exec->>RMQ: execucao.finalizada
  RMQ->>OS: FINALIZADA + saga COMPLETED
  Cliente->>OS: POST entregar
